      <div class="section-label">Documentation</div>
      <h1>User Guide</h1>
      <p class="lead">Pocket Curio is two tabs — <strong>Shelves</strong> and <strong>Map</strong> — and one fast way in: the camera. This guide walks through the first launch, collections, adding a souvenir, the whole-shelf scan, the map, backups, and the free tier.</p>
    </div>

